#exam-pointer(title: "High-Yield Memory Hooks for CUET 2027 GAT GK")[
  Keep these fundamental factual anchors and decision rules primed:
  - *Constitutional Remedies:* Article 32 is the "Heart & Soul"; High Courts issue writs under Article 226.
  - *Preamble Additions:* 42nd Amendment (1976) added *Socialist, Secular, and Integrity*.
  - *Bretton Woods Twins:* IMF and World Bank are both headquartered in *Washington, D.C.*.
  - *World vs India Peak:* Mount Everest is the world's highest (Nepal); Kanchenjunga is India's highest undisputed peak.
  - *Civilian vs Military Peak:* Bharat Ratna is civilian; Param Vir Chakra is wartime military. Never swap them!
  - *Floating National Park:* Keibul Lamjao on Loktak Lake, Manipur (Sangai deer).
  - *National Space Day:* *August 23*, commemorating Chandrayaan-3's lunar south pole soft landing.
]

